tests/fixtures/starlink-sample.omm.json, worlds/night/assets/starlink.omm.json
  Samples of public GP element sets (OMM JSON) for Starlink and the ISS from CelesTrak
  (celestrak.org, data from the US Space Force's space-track.org), downloaded 2026-11-18
  (epochs 2026-11-14 to 2026-11-18). Public orbital data, redistributed as samples; no endorsement.
  Element sets age: fetch fresh ones for real-time use.

